	(text "1k: DSACKx (also the 68882 holding resistors), STERM, CBACK,\nCIIN, AVEC, BERR, BR, BGACK.  10k: IPL2..0 (blank CPLD =\nno interrupt), CDIS, MMUDIS.  RESET_n/HALT_n: reset sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 124.46 0)
		(effects
